  <!--6a-->
  <exercise data-content-id="a48a9b81-e218-4090-943c-5f7c96c157c4" data-problem-comparator="text" data-problem-type="input" data-solution="+2">
    <problem>
      <para>Enter the missing numbers, including the signs, for the expression when \(g(x)=2x^2−20x+32\) is written in vertex form. \(g(x)= \underline{\;\mathbf a\boldsymbol.\;} (x + \underline{\;\mathbf b\boldsymbol.\;} )^2 \underline{\;\mathbf c\boldsymbol.\;}\) </para>
      <para>What is the value of the missing number, including the sign, in place of letter a?</para>
      <para>Enter the missing number, including the sign. </para>
    </problem>
    <solution>
      <para>Correct! +2</para>
    </solution>
    <div class="os-raise-ib-pset-encourage-response">
      <para>Try again. Revisit activity 9.10.4. </para>
    </div>
    </exercise>
  <!--6b-->
  <exercise data-content-id="2308bf80-4901-486c-9dbe-19b42780bfb3" data-problem-comparator="integer" data-problem-type="input" data-solution="-5">
    <problem>
      <para>What is the value of the missing number, including the sign, in place of letter b?</para>
      <para>Enter the missing number, including the sign. </para>
